## 🌷 01. About the Activity

This activity explores how **Artificial Intelligence (AI)** responds to different prompts when generating images. By comparing a simple prompt with a more detailed one, we can understand how clear instructions help AI create images that better match our ideas.

> ♡ **Main takeaway:** The more specific and detailed the prompt, the more accurately AI can represent the user's intended idea.

---

## 🩰 02. Prompt Experiment

### 🎀 Prompt 01 — The Simple Prompt

<details>
<summary>💗 Click to view the first prompt and its result</summary>

**Prompt used:**

> Make me a photo of a school.

**AI-generated result:**

The AI generated a beautiful, modern school building with a clean entrance, green trees, a wide driveway, and a bright blue sky. The school looked peaceful, organized, and welcoming to students.

**Observation:** 

This prompt was short and general. It allowed the AI to create a school environment without many specific instructions.

</details>

### 🦢 Prompt 02 — The Detailed Prompt

<details>
<summary>💜 Click to view the second prompt and its result</summary>

**Prompt used:**

> Make me a photo of a beautiful girl entering Ateneo de Davao School in school uniform with her Birkin bag checked by a guard. Brown hair, light to medium skin tone.

**AI-generated result:**

The image showed a student entering Ateneo de Davao University while a security guard inspected her bag. The scene included the school entrance, campus buildings, trees, and details about the student's appearance, uniform, and belongings.

**Observation:**

This prompt included more specific instructions about the subject, location, clothing, appearance, belongings, and activity. These details helped guide the AI toward a more personalized scene.

</details>

---

## 🪻 03. Comparing the Two Prompts

| Feature | Prompt 01 🌸 | Prompt 02 🦋 |
|:---|:---|:---|
| Instructions | Simple and general | Specific and detailed |
| Main subject | School building | Student entering school |
| Details | Architecture and surroundings | Appearance, uniform, bag, and security check |
| Result | A welcoming school environment | A more personalized campus scene |
| Level of control | Limited | More guided |

---

## 🧸 04. What I Learned

Through this activity, I learned that **prompting plays an important role in AI image generation**. A simple prompt can produce a good image, but it may not include all the details I have in mind.

When I added more information to my second prompt, I was able to describe the scene more clearly. This showed me that AI tools work better when users provide understandable and specific instructions.

I also realized that experimenting with different prompts is a useful way to improve creativity, communication, and digital skills.

---

## 🌼 05. Key Takeaways

- 🎨 **Be specific.** Include important details in your prompt.
- 📝 **Describe the subject.** Explain what or who should appear in the image.
- 🌈 **Add context.** Mention the setting, activity, clothing, and surroundings.
- 🪄 **Experiment.** Try different ways of expressing your idea.
- 💡 **Review the result.** Check whether the generated image matches your intention.

---

## 🫧 06. Conclusion

AI tools can transform written ideas into visual representations. This activity helped me understand that effective prompting requires clear descriptions and thoughtful instructions. By improving the details in a prompt, I can guide AI to generate images that more closely match what I imagine.

*Small details can make a big difference!* ♡

